config BR2_PACKAGE_JFLITE
	bool "flite (for jaded's speech fallback)"
	depends on BR2_USE_WCHAR
	help
	  Flite, the small CMU speech synthesiser, built as a separate package from Buildroot's own `flite` so that
	  WPE WebKit does not switch on its (unbuildable without multimedia) speech synthesis support when it sees it.
